===============================================================================
Acknowledgements and Upstream Lineage
===============================================================================

This software incorporates architectural concepts, designs, and algorithmic lineage
from the following open-source projects:

1. Serena
   - Project: Serena
   - Repository: https://github.com/oraios/serena
   - Copyright: Copyright (c) 2025 Oraios AI
   - License: MIT License

   Astrolabe acknowledges and builds upon concepts inspired by Serena,
   including tiered instruction architecture (L1-L3), client alignment
   mechanisms (dual-marker boundary detection, structuredContent governance),
   and PreToolUse anti-drift hooks.

2. OpenVisio
   - Project: OpenVisio
   - Repository: https://github.com/syntaxPriest/openvisio-oss
   - Copyright: Copyright (c) 2026 OpenVisio contributors
   - License: MIT License

   Astrolabe acknowledges and builds upon concepts inspired by OpenVisio,
   including folder architecture group graph aggregation (toGroupGraph), bidirectional BFS multi-hop neighborhood exploration,
   and topological centrality hotspots analysis.

